    0.011     0.008     0.552
    0.011     0.008     0.590
    0.011     0.008     0.660
    ...
    0.011     0.015     2.987
    0.011     0.015     3.038
    0.011     0.016     3.431
    0.011     0.016     4.707

After the change:
